WEBVTT

00:13:59.756 --> 00:14:02.981
An indigenous medicine woman once told me

00:14:03.005 --> 00:14:06.454
that love is to walk on Mother Earth

00:14:06.478 --> 00:14:08.859
as her most beloved child,

00:14:10.108 --> 00:14:14.866
to trust that she values
an honest intention

00:14:14.890 --> 00:14:17.044
and knows how to guide our steps.

00:14:17.808 --> 00:14:19.882
I hope I have inspired you

00:14:19.906 --> 00:14:23.453
to start reconnecting
with the food of your ancestors.

00:14:23.477 --> 00:14:24.936
Thank you for listening.

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:27.141
(Applause)